      <title>Google以130亿欧元投资芬兰AI基础设施</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260909/Google%E4%BB%A5130%E4%BA%BF%E6%AC%A7%E5%85%83%E6%8A%95%E8%B5%84%E8%8A%AC%E5%85%B0AI%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD/</link>
